<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-jinshu" book-id="b-jinshu-068" chapter-id="c-jinshu-068-jin076-zhangkai" source-id="s-jinshu-068-jin076-zhangkai">
  <p id="c-jinshu-068-jin076-zhangkai:he" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">廷尉<persName id="c-jinshu-068-jin076-zhangkai:he:m0002" ref="076_097_db5">張闓</persName>住在小市，將奪左右近宅以廣其居，乃私作都門，早閉晏開，人多患之，論於州府，皆不見省。</p>
  <p id="c-jinshu-068-jin076-zhangkai:resolution" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-068-jin076-zhangkai:resolution:m0000" ref="626_bb5_ba2">循</persName>曰：「見<persName id="c-jinshu-068-jin076-zhangkai:resolution:m0005" ref="076_097_db5">張廷尉</persName>，當為言及之。」<persName id="c-jinshu-068-jin076-zhangkai:resolution:m0016" ref="076_097_db5">闓</persName>聞而遽毀其門，詣<persName id="c-jinshu-068-jin076-zhangkai:resolution:m0025" ref="626_bb5_ba2">循</persName>致謝。</p>
  <p id="c-jinshu-068-jin076-zhangkai:xue" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-068-jin076-zhangkai:xue:m0000" ref="i8f_2hf_xm5">薛兼</persName>，字<persName id="c-jinshu-068-jin076-zhangkai:xue:m0004" ref="i8f_2hf_xm5">令長</persName>，丹陽人也。</p>
</text>
